From: aiden build <build@aiden.local>
Subject: [PATCH] adb: build transport_mdns/mdns_utils and link dns_sd

Add the mDNS client sources to libadb and link the avahi libdns_sd
compatibility library (Bonjour API) so adb's <dns_sd.h> calls resolve.

Aiden-local patch (re-enables mDNS that nmeum disabled for the client).
---
--- a/vendor/CMakeLists.adb.txt
+++ b/vendor/CMakeLists.adb.txt
@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@
 	core/adb/client/usb_dispatch.cpp
 	core/adb/client/usb_libusb.cpp
 	core/adb/client/usb_linux.cpp
+	core/adb/client/transport_mdns.cpp
+	core/adb/client/mdns_utils.cpp
 	core/adb/pairing_auth/aes_128_gcm.cpp
 	core/adb/pairing_auth/pairing_auth.cpp
 	core/adb/pairing_connection/pairing_connection.cpp
@@ -195,4 +197,5 @@
 	pthread
 	usb-1.0
 	z
-	zstd)
+	zstd
+	dns_sd)
